nhanced traceability purposes</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 group self-stretch"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782368067/eurocert/f2.webp.webp" class="w-full h-full object-contain transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="FSSC 22000 Overview"/></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Why The Update</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Reason of Revision</h2></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5"><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-file-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">ISO 22003-1:2022</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Scheme updated to incorporate specific requirements outlined in ISO 22003-1:2022.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-globe-americas text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">UN SDGs Support</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Stronger requirements to 